            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "The DEWALT DWE7491RS is the safest default. It combines a rack-and-pinion fence that stays parallel to the blade, a 32-1/2 inch rip capacity that handles full plywood sheets, a rolling stand and a full set of safety equipment. Buy the SawStop if safety is the priority, or the Bosch 4100XC-10 if you move the saw constantly."
