        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          In This Guide
        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#what-matters" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. What Actually Matters</a>
          <a href="#rip-fence" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. Rip Capacity and Fence Quality</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. The Seven Picks</a>
          <a href="#comparison" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. Comparison Table</a>
          <a href="#safety" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Guards, Riving Knives and Kickback</a>
          <a href="#sawstop" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Flesh-Sensing Technology</a>
          <a href="#stands-dust" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Stands and Dust Collection</a>
