          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best jobsite table saw is the one with a fence that stays parallel to the blade and enough rip capacity for the work you do. For most people that is the DEWALT DWE7491RS, with the SawStop Jobsite Saw PRO for anyone who puts safety first and the Bosch 4100XC-10 for anyone who moves the saw all day.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
